{#
  Partial: a person named on a curator desk, as App\Moderation\DeskRider
  answers. A rider with a public profile is their display name linked to that
  profile; everyone else is their stable pseudonym, not linked. A rider whose
  account no longer exists has no name (null) and is the removed label, never
  linked. A fellow curator (DeskRider::colleague) is always their display name,
  linked the same way (moderation-and-contribution.md, curator-facing naming).

  Parameters:
    rider  array{name:?string, uuid:?string}
#}
{%- if rider.name is null -%}
{{ 'moderate.rider_removed'|trans }}
{%- elseif rider.uuid -%}
<a class="desk-rider" href="{{ path('rider_profile', {uuid: rider.uuid}) }}">{{ rider.name }}</a>
{%- else -%}
{{ rider.name }}
{%- endif -%}
